OL,3,GNEWSAWoman avoids jail after fatal dog
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old woman has avoided jail
OL,7,Fafter a man was killed in a dog attack
OL,8,Fand his daughter was seriously injured.
OL,10,FJune Miles, of Friary Road, Atherstone,
OL,11,Fdenied perverting the course of justice
OL,12,Fafter the death of Anthony Harrington
OL,13,Fat a house in Meriden, Solihull, in
OL,14,FNovember 2023.
OL,16,FShe was found not guilty of this
OL,17,Fcharge, however, she admitted to owning
OL,18,Fa dangerously out-of-control dog in
OL,19,Fconnection with serious injuries
OL,20,Fsuffered by daughter Wendy Harrington
OL,21,Fat the same address.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
