OL,3,GNEWSAWoman avoids jail after fatal dog
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiles was sentenced to 18 weeks'
OL,7,Fimprisonment, suspended for 20 months
OL,8,Fat Warwick Crown Court on Tuesday. She
OL,9,Fwas also ordered to complete 100 hours
OL,10,Funpaid work and pay a victim surcharge.
